  "notes": "Layered brucite lattice-average empirical volume EOS, including H rearrangement; not a hydrogen-order-resolved thermodynamic fit or a phase-boundary model. Fukui describes a higher-order H change; Sun (2025) XRD supports the layered average lattice beyond this range. Ambient atomic sites are a reference only. Ambient Mg(OH)2 structure from Zigan and Rothbauer (1967), CC0 COD 1000054; original structural paper not directly inspected. Source structure and EOS samples differ; no rescaling. All 102 Fukui/Xia observations preserved.",
